{"id":1020,"date":"2023-01-16T08:20:18","date_gmt":"2023-01-16T07:20:18","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/voyagermenorca.com\/privacy-policy\/"},"modified":"2026-03-06T14:48:39","modified_gmt":"2026-03-06T13:48:39","slug":"politica-privacidad","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/voyagermenorca.com\/en\/politica-privacidad\/","title":{"rendered":"Privacy Policy"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"1020\" class=\"elementor elementor-1020 elementor-3\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-226d90ec legal e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"226d90ec\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-90f83d7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"90f83d7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Data Controller<\/h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Owner:<\/strong> Daniel Vaquera Sintes<\/li>\n<li><strong>ID:<\/strong> 41742432P<\/li>\n<li><strong>Trade name:<\/strong> Voyager Menorca<\/li>\n<li><strong>Address:<\/strong> Domingo Savio 86 Pb, 07760 | CIUTADELLA DE MENORCA<\/li>\n<li><strong>Email:<\/strong> info@voyagermenorca.com<\/li>\n<li><strong>Web:<\/strong> <a href=\"http:\/\/www.voyagermenorca.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">www.voyagermenorca.com<\/a><\/li>\n<\/ul><div>Voyager Menorca (Daniel Vaquera Sintes) is registered in the Island Register of Companies, Activities and Tourist Establishments of Menorca, with the numbers MT0054ME (tourist mediator) and TA0051ME (active tourism company). In addition, it has a current civil liability insurance for the development of active tourism activities, in accordance with the tourism regulations applicable in the Balearic Islands. <\/div><div><br><\/div>\n<h2>Purpose of Data Processing<\/h2>\n<p>The personal data collected through the website will be used for the following purposes:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Management of reservations and requested tourist services.<\/li>\n<li>Customer service and management of inquiries through contact forms.<\/li>\n<li>Sending commercial and promotional communications, when the user has authorized it.<\/li>\n<li>Administrative, accounting and fiscal management derived from the provision of services.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h2>Legal Basis of the Processing<\/h2>\n<p>The processing of personal data is carried out by virtue of the consent granted by the user when accepting this privacy policy and using the contact and reservation forms.<\/p>\n<h2>Data Retention<\/h2>\n<p>The personal data provided will be kept for the time necessary to fulfill the purposes for which they were collected and to determine the possible responsibilities that may arise from said purpose, in addition to the periods established in the regulations on files and documentation.<\/p>\n<h2>Communication of Data to Third Parties<\/h2>\n<p>Data will not be transferred to third parties, except legal obligation or if it is necessary for the provision of the requested service. In such cases, the data may be shared with: <\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Public Administrations in compliance with legal obligations.<\/li>\n<li>Tourist service providers when necessary to manage the reservation.<\/li>\n<li>Data processors that manage services such as web hosting or email marketing.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h2>International Data Transfers<\/h2>\n<p>International data transfers outside the European Economic Area (EEA) will not be carried out without the prior consent of the user.<\/p>\n<h2>User Rights<\/h2>\n<p>The user has the right to:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Access their personal data.<\/li>\n<li>Request the rectification of inaccurate or incomplete data.<\/li>\n<li>Request the deletion of their data when they are no longer necessary.<\/li>\n<li>Oppose the processing of their data for specific purposes.<\/li>\n<li>Request the limitation of the processing of their data in certain cases.<\/li>\n<li>Request the portability of their data to another controller.<\/li>\n<li>Withdraw consent at any time.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>To exercise these rights, the user can send an email to info@voyagermenorca.com.<\/p>\n<h2>Security Measures<\/h2>\n<p>Voyager Menorca adopts the technical and organizational measures necessary to guarantee the security of personal data and prevent its alteration, loss, treatment or unauthorized access, taking into account the state of the technology, the nature of the data and the risks to which they are exposed.<\/p>\n<h2>Cookies Policy<\/h2>\n<p>The website uses cookies to optimize the user experience. For more information, see our <a href=\"#\">Cookies Policy<\/a>. <\/p>\n<h2>Modifications of the Privacy Policy<\/h2>\n<p>Voyager Menorca reserves the right to modify this policy to adapt it to new legislative or jurisprudential developments. Any changes will be published on this same page. <\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Data Controller Owner: Daniel Vaquera Sintes ID: 41742432P Trade name: Voyager Menorca Address: Domingo Savio 86 Pb, 07760 | CIUTADELLA DE MENORCA Email: info@voyagermenorca.com Web: www.voyagermenorca.com Voyager Menorca (Daniel Vaquera [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-1020","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO Premium plugin v28.3 (Yoast SEO v28.8) - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-premium-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>Privacy Policy - Guided Tours in Menorca<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Voyager Menorca Privacy Policy. Learn how we protect your personal data in our guided tours and excursions servic